  "title": "V2X and Amazon to Partner on Smart Warehousing and Global Logistics Automation",
  "summary": "RESTON, Va., Jan. 29, 2026 /PRNewswire/ — V2X, Inc. (NYSE: VVX) today announced a key strategic partnership with Amazon to deliver smart warehousing and automation technologies to the companies’ mutual U.S. Government customers to support a diverse and global mission set. V2X will leverage Amazon’s extensive knowledge of warehouse automation, including its advanced computer-vision AI models, across […]",
